WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Shen Xiujin, who do you think you are?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,050
Do you have the final say in everything in the world?

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,050
You said he is your Shen Xiujin's thing

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:11,060
He is yours, Shen Xiujin!

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:22,300
If he is really your thing

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,430
Know everything you need to know

7
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,430
Not only do I know what’s different about his body from others

8
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:30,830
I have also touched

9
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,760
Just on the left lower back

10
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,760
last time

11
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:42,750
Shen Yi, take action

12
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:45,200
Four minutes, time's up

13
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,090
Next

14
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:56,700
He left it to Young Master Xiao to associate with Xiao Heng of the Western Regions
